  "text": "```verilog\nmodule sync_reset #\n(\n    parameter N = 2\n)\n(\n    input  wire clk,\n    input  wire rst,\n    output wire out\n);\n\n    localparam DEPTH = (N < 2) ? 2 : N;\n\n    reg [DEPTH-1:0] sync_reg;\n\n    always @(posedge clk or posedge rst) begin\n        if (rst)\n            sync_reg <= {DEPTH{1'b1}};\n        else\n            sync_reg <= {sync_reg[DEPTH-2:0], 1'b0};\n    end\n\n    assign out = sync_reg[DEPTH-1];\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>",
